soon be totally destroyed.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.240
So what did they do?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.150
They move the grave.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.470
Meaning they move their
little bit of sovereignty

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:37.300
from right here all the way up here,

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:40.500
85 kilometers north, still inside Syria.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.090
Why didn't they just move it into Turkey?

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:44.530
So this border, this
little conclave of Turkey

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:45.830
just moved up.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.420
Okay, so now it has a new location.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:49.700
It doesn't stop there,
so the dam is built,

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:53.510
the tomb is safe, there is
now a lake called Lake Assad

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:54.640
after the dictator.

00:08:54.640 --> 00:08:57.260
Fast forward another half century,

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.470
